  "title": "2026-07-25-eval-160035 · code-review-agents",
  "description": "# Multi-agent automated code review\n\nA left-to-right, top-to-bottom lifecycle from pull-request intake through context budgeting, parallel specialist review, aggregation, high-severity verification, and policy-driven publication. The lower controls show two critical loops: head changes cancel and restart work against the new diff, while human feedback calibrates future confidence thresholds. Telemetry tracks operational and quality outcomes; exceeding the daily repository budget degrades later runs to correctness and security only.",
